#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""MiniCut Patch 52 - Effect editor reworked: same look as the node editor, working wires, live preview

WHY: in the effect editor the blocks could not be connected, it looked unlike the rest of the program, and effects built
in it did not run. This patch contains everything of Patch 50 and 51 as well (it accepts the files before or after them).

THE LOOK
* Cards, dotted canvas, sockets and wires are those of the main node editor and follow the app's dark theme (UI[...]),
  with a block-colour set of its own. Buttons, fields and panels use the program's own style.

THE WIRES (the bug)
* Connecting now works exactly like in the main node editor: the socket itself handles press / move / release, and the
  target is found with scene.items(). A wire can be picked up from the socket it ends in and dropped on another socket
  (or on empty space to remove it). Socket types must match; a wire that would make a loop is refused with a message.

FEATURES
* Undo / Redo, Copy / Paste (also between two effects), Cut, Duplicate, Mute, Arrange, box select, Fit, right-click menu.
* Search a block: Tab (or double-click on empty canvas), or the list on the left (English and Thai words).
* Every number / colour parameter is on the card and has a socket: wire a value block into it (Time, Wave (LFO),
  Map Range, Parameter, Constant, Math) and the parameter follows it.
* The key button beside a parameter offers it as a slider of the effect (inspector, keyframes); its name can be changed in
  the Sliders panel.
* New blocks: Solid Color, Gradient, Checkerboard (pictures), Wave (LFO), Map Range (values).
* Live preview: ONE picture - a media of the project, a file, or a test picture - looping every 3 seconds; it renders at a
  reduced size that adapts to the speed of the effect, and a still effect is drawn once and then left alone.

EARLIER FIXES (50, 51): opening the editor, the compiler (20 of 23 blocks did not run), Mute, Thai effect names that
overwrote each other, atomic saving, speed (Hue/Sat, Over).

PATCH SYSTEM: this patch keeps its backup in <launcher folder>/_patch_backup (where the Launcher looks for it, so
"Undo Last Update" works) and finds the program folder whether it is run by the Launcher or by hand from Patch/.

Files changed: minicut/render/fxpack/custom.py, minicut/workspace/fx_node_editor.py
Files added:   minicut/workspace/fx_graph_model.py, minicut/workspace/fx_preview_engine.py
  python Patch/apply_52_effect_editor_rework.py --check | (install) | --revert      Close MiniCut before installing.
"""
import base64, datetime, hashlib, json, os, py_compile, shutil, sys, zlib
PATCH_NAME = "patch52_effect_editor_rework"
